Output should be -2, 0, 4, 7, 21.

The function provided is a flawed implementation of selection sort method. There is a mistake in the part of code that should swap the values of `nums[i]` and `nums[j]` when `nums[i]` is greater than `nums[j]`.

This part of the code:
```java
