The current function uses recursion, but it does not utilize dynamic programming as it repeatedly calculates the same sub-problems. Instead, we should keep track of solved sub-problems so that they do not have to be solved multiple times.

In addition, the function should not return a string message for error handling. It should rather raise an Exception for erroneous input.

