&lt;p&gt;How many $4$-input ternary truth tables, $\tau$, satisfy the formula
$$\tau(a, b, c, d) \mathbin{\text{MIN}} \tau(b, c, d, a \mathbin{\text{MAX}} (b \mathbin{\text{MIN}} c)) = 0$$
